bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    wm_local_lane_clock_tick_full_repaint_2026-11-26, 0, "Engine2dWmFrameExecutor.retained_scene_damage_plan (engine2d_wm_frame_executor.spl) returned a FULL plan on any clock-label change, so every hosted local-lane clock tick repainted the whole frame instead of replaying the clock box through the retained damage executor."

